# Space Weather Forecasting: SWAPI Thermodynamic State Optimization

This repository contains the data-driven state optimization pipeline used to initialize baseline boundaries for downstream fuzzy-HMM and EML-ODE solar wind profiling.

## Repository Contents
* `IMAP_SWAPI_L1_2026-03-15_2026-04-15.csv`: Raw input plasma telemetry.
* `state_optimization_pipeline.py`: Code execution loop evaluating K=2 to K=8.
* `swapi_state_estimation.png`: Visualization File - Model-selection plot and
Scatter plot of density vs. velocity colored by assigned state

